Changes adapt this implementation to Transformers 5 Cache/GenerationMixin,
safe config dispatch, persistent FP32 rotary computation, safetensors,
initialization and module-plan ownership. They do not use checkpoint Python.

StableLM Epoch metadata semantics were inspected from Stability AI's
japanese-stablelm-3b-4e1t-base revision
e7d2ebdd200a28be321058be9a67514780073736. Its Apache-2.0 modeling headers credit
EleutherAI and the HuggingFace Inc. team. No Epoch modeling source is vendored;
the adapter uses source-matched native Transformers StableLM computation.

Yi-Coder config/header metadata was inspected from 01-ai/Yi-Coder-1.5B-Chat
revision 92fdd1b2f1539ac990e7f4a921db5601da2f0299. No Yi model or weights are
vendored. The published config selects the native Llama architecture.

Transformers modeling implementations remain dependencies under their own
Apache-2.0 license and original notices. Source pins, SHA256 hashes and test
scope are documented in README.md and checkpoint_inventory.json.
